        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the common red flags to watch out for when hiring local packers and movers in Alipurduar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Beware of movers who request large cash advances, lack IBA approval or ISO certification, provide vague cost estimates, or do not issue a GST‑compliant invoice. Reliable providers will present transparent tariffs, a signed agreement, and clear insurance terms before any work begins.</p>
