        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard 850 km move usually takes 2‑3 days of transit, plus loading and unloading time. Factors affecting the schedule include weather conditions, highway traffic, checkpoint clearances, and the volume of goods. Our route performance highlights show a 95% on‑time delivery rate.</p>
